# qyne-web is a marketing site: no Supabase, no auth. Its one backend read is
# the public article catalogue from qyne-service.
# The only (optional) config is where "Log in" / "Sign up" hand off to — the
# QYNE app (dashboard). Leave unset to derive it from the host: staging.qyne.one
# → app.staging.qyne.one, qyne.one → app.qyne.one. Set explicitly in production.
# Vite only exposes VITE_-prefixed vars to the client.
VITE_APP_URL=

# qyne-service base URL, read only for the public article catalogue (/articles).
# Leave unset to derive it: local dev → /api (Vite proxies to staging),
# staging.qyne.one → api.staging.qyne.one, qyne.one → api.qyne.one.
# Set explicitly in production, and add the site's origin to the service's
# CORS_ORIGINS.
VITE_API_URL=
